# Mock Infrastructure CI Patterns

## Environment Variables (set in CI jobs)

```yaml
env:
  CLOUD_PROVIDER: local
  CLOUD_MOCK_MODE: "true"
  # Optional — set when emulator containers are running:
  PUBSUB_EMULATOR_HOST: localhost:8085
  STORAGE_EMULATOR_HOST: http://localhost:4443
  BIGQUERY_EMULATOR_HOST: localhost:9050
```

## GitHub Actions Service Containers (GCP Emulators)

```yaml
services:
  pubsub-emulator:
    image: gcr.io/google.com/cloudsdktool/google-cloud-cli
    options: >-
      --entrypoint gcloud
    command: beta emulators pubsub start --host-port=0.0.0.0:8085 --project=mock-project
    ports:
      - 8085:8085
```

## Network Blocking (Credential-Free Gate)

```bash
pytest --block-network  # blocks all sockets; any live call fails with ConnectionError
```

Plugin: `unified-trading-pm/scripts/dev/network_block_plugin.py`
Opt-out: `@pytest.mark.allow_network` (emulator connections only, never live APIs)

