See: `unified-trading-pm/codex/06-coding-standards/integration-testing-layers.md`

## No Credentials in CI

CI tests must pass with `CLOUD_MOCK_MODE=true` and NO secrets injected. If a test requires a secret, it belongs in the
`sandbox` mark and must be skipped by default: `pytest -m "not sandbox"`.
